    "catalog:note": "Freestanding island: three 600 base modules with their doors to the back and a worktop that overhangs the front by 0.30 for seating. top 0.90. Worktop 0.04 on a cabinet with a plinth 0.15 high set back 0.05.",
    "catalog:basedOn": "EN 1116 co-ordinating sizes as given in the drafting standard key dimensions (600 module, worktop 0.90, worktop 0.04); EN 1116 itself not read, unverified. Island 1.80 x 0.90 is three 600 modules plus a 0.30 overhang, not checked against a published source",
